{
  "_doc": [
    "Hand-measured crops of assets/rpg/heroes/<id>.png (1280x720), used by tools/rpg-assets.py.",
    "face  = face centre (nose, between the eye line and the mouth) in source px; focal() = face / (1280, 720).",
    "token = side of the square face crop centred on `face` (optional dx/dy shift it), scaled to 256x256;",
    "        sized ~3.7x the eye distance so every face fills the circular token about equally.",
    "card  = 3:4 rectangle (x, y, w, h) in source px, head to thigh, face in the upper fifth; scaled to 480x640.",
    "src   = sha1[:12] of the PNG the crop was measured on; the tool warns when the art changes.",
    "        After re-checking a changed image: python3 tools/rpg-assets.py --stamp <id>."
